WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.903
A wrong link or a failing server should never leave anyone stranded.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.916
Open a link that no longer exists, and the member app says Page not found, keeps the

00:00:12.916 --> 00:00:15.557
address, and moves focus to the heading.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.582
Two links lead back, Go to home and Browse events, by touch or by keyboard.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.509
Staff see the same screen in the admin console, with Go to dashboard and Manage

00:00:30.509 --> 00:00:31.208
events.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:38.439
When the server fails while a screen loads, the app says Something went wrong, owns

00:00:38.439 --> 00:00:40.558
the failure, and offers Try again.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:48.807
Every server error from the API now carries a reference, built from the request's

00:00:48.807 --> 00:00:52.668
trace, so a member can quote it and an operator can find it.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:59.119
A crafted link cannot put its own words there, and Try again only returns to a page

00:00:59.119 --> 00:01:00.344
inside the app.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:06.349
Both screens load only when needed. The first load is two hundred and twenty

00:01:06.349 --> 00:01:09.625
kilobytes, under the limit of two hundred and fifty.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:15.641
Every test failed first. Now fourteen browser specs, forty-three unit tests and the

00:01:15.641 --> 00:01:16.960
API tests pass.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:22.123
Next, the first screen that loads data switches on the interceptor.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:28.052
That's slice thirty point one. Christian Fitness: a Christian community for health

00:01:28.052 --> 00:01:29.291
in body and spirit.
